interested in Lojban who have limited abilities in english. I wish is 
for more resources about lojban in Japanese. If I learn lojban in the 
future I will be willing to help this effort but something if there 
was something out there in advanced it would help to motivate me and 
probably many other Japanese speaking people to learn this 
interesting langauge. So please if there are any Lojban resources in 
Japanese that already exist please post them here, or if somebody is 
interested in helping out with such a project please also post your 
thoughts. 
